{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他因为重新感受到熟悉的亲近而满心欢喜，很想把藏着的心意告诉对方，却始终没有完全说出口。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"欢喜、心动、迫切、紧张、犹豫、不舍\",\n      \"missed\": \"他具体为什么不敢说，需要读下方长句才能抓到：怕说得太多让对方为难，也怕破坏两个人原有的自在。声线、花腔、水波倒数的画面细节一眼不容易全部抓住。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他越来越想向亲近的人坦白藏着的话，但越想留住眼前的亲密，越害怕说出口会改变两人的关系。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"心动、欢喜、急切、忐忑、紧绷、舍不得\",\n      \"missed\": \"一眼能抓到想说又不敢说，但不容易同时抓到左手水波像倒数的画面，以及他害怕给对方压力、失去原有相处自在的具体顾虑。下半部分动画节点较密，也会分走一些注意力。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他已经几乎要把心意说出来了，话到了嘴边却发紧，既想留住此刻的亲近，又怕坦白之后失去原来的自在。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"满心欢喜、心动、迫切、喉头发紧、犹豫、不舍\",\n      \"missed\": \"新增的长颤音像夕阳金光、音乐攀高后逐渐收弱等画面，需要逐句读才能理解；新增粉色文字还需要与人物的情绪联系起来，底部关于害怕让对方为难的顾虑也不容易一眼完整抓到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 4,\n  \"main_problem\": \"主线其实很明确：亲近带来的欢喜、想说出心意、害怕破坏关系，最后有所保留，几块内容能够串成同一个人的情绪变化。最影响扫读的是三块大字号长句都承载了多层意思，视觉上又有相近的分量，中间和下方还夹着多条粉色音乐画面描写。第一眼能抓到想说又不敢说，但不容易迅速区分哪些是人物主线、哪些是音乐细节。第3张新增的两行粉色文字进一步增加了扫读负担，不过也让音乐变化与话到嘴边发紧的情绪联系得更具体。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b14bc2c9-cdc0-47d6-a654-9861b066fc56", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261109T224047749272Z", "elapsed_seconds": 103.547, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T22:42:31.311850+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a0c88225cde26aada884759381adfb385ecf839d473508f5e1b084fb7931679b", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261109T224047749272Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "e6800cfc6b059dd167d05e5ae8ecdbf04eff8bf2e1c0e2a8b6604dd587adabec"}}}
